Z||000000||contra||10-09-2000||11:52 PM||||After all the hard work i've put into my fiero, i'm finding that there is never a week or two i dont have problems with my fiero. I dont really mind fixing my fiero, it's great fun, but being 18 and limited in my cash, i dont think i can afford to keep fixing things. I think later on when i'm a bit more cash ready i will buy another one and turn it into a kitcar in my spare time.<P>For now, i'm going to sell my fiero for as much as i can, and i'm looking into importing a '95 mitsubishi eclipse gs-t or gsx to canada. (surprisingly enough it's cheaper than buying an eagle talon here! dont ask why i dunno)<P>when i'm ready to sell, you'll see a posting in the mall. i'm sure some of you have seen the pics. still looks as good as it did then!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>dont worry tho<BR>i havent totally defected<BR>i still own 2 other fieros...<BR>heheh scared ya for a little bit didn't i?  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><BR>||||reg||5
